{"h":3396,"lines":[{"y":0.03197674401572248,"h":0.016020900088288825,"c":1,"w":0.063786010742187482,"t":"Test 2","x":0.84979423732780879},{"y":0.081224345054499603,"t":"WOMAN.","h":0.0090629377690867319,"c":1,"w":0.05976906458536782,"x":0.071967319456117812},{"w":0.63786010742187504,"t":"Really? I might be interested in that. I'll have a look through the photos and see.","h":0.016034596379148613,"x":0.16872426715245314,"y":0.078488371946211499,"c":1},{"t":"Oh, and talking of fixing photos - I've got a few that aren't properly in focus. Can","c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.63991770426432293,"x":0.17078188850192627,"y":0.094476744039704963},{"y":0.11042402842063836,"w":0.29423868815104171,"h":0.011778563015312216,"x":0.16872427723559033,"t":"you do anything to make that better?","c":1},{"t":"EMPLOYEE:","h":0.011271764308179,"c":1,"x":0.073938476046026241,"w":0.078460496266682944,"y":0.12590481550799004},{"c":1,"y":0.1249999998781991,"h":0.013103651354534729,"x":0.16255143833986413,"t":"No, I'm afraid that's one thing we can't do.","w":0.34567901611328128},{"w":0.05761316935221357,"x":0.074074073657226555,"y":0.14244186038683104,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"h":0.0072674419910804255},{"x":0.16872428000723128,"t":"OK.","y":0.13953488354887067,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.032921810150146502},{"h":0.012379958576251737,"y":0.15514722980984907,"w":0.078406480153401695,"t":"EMPLOYEE:","x":0.073965485296685243,"c":1},{"x":0.1604938308280732,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"t":"Any other information I can give you?","y":0.1554770316930858,"w":0.30864196777343755},{"c":1,"w":0.059670778910319008,"y":0.17296511616947052,"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.010174418787512463,"x":0.072016462297485997},{"y":0.17137809203748144,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"t":"Er ... oh, how long will it all take?","x":0.17078189054567938,"w":0.2654321034749349},{"w":0.078225428263346344,"h":0.010313891128881481,"c":1,"t":"EMPLOYEE:","y":0.18743026360932835,"x":0.074056010919309898},{"w":0.36008229573567707,"x":0.16255144453595108,"y":0.18604651148930551,"h":0.014534883982160851,"t":"We aim to get the copying done in ten days.","c":1},{"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"x":0.071980298967278589,"h":0.0089713002262182817,"y":0.20336318708103684,"w":0.059743105570475269},{"w":0.63168726603190106,"x":0.16872426810533719,"h":0.016020900088288936,"t":"Fine. Right, well I'll get the photos packed up in a box and post them off to you.","y":0.20200235586645543,"c":1},{"t":"EMPLOYEE:","x":0.074015126705122919,"y":0.21779212158237304,"w":0.078307196299235021,"h":0.010636686857513289,"c":1},{"t":"Right. If you've got a strong cardboard box, that's best. We've found that plastic","w":0.65241032918294262,"x":0.1542498495237003,"y":0.21636063562155228,"h":0.018434024109857283,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"t":"ones sometimes break in the post.","w":0.27572016398111981,"y":0.23401162778246487,"x":0.16872428008806717},{"y":0.24999999990605781,"w":0.059670778910319008,"h":0.008720930389296333,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.072016462297485997},{"y":0.24852767951296006,"t":"OK. Right, thanks for your help. Bye.","w":0.29629628499348959,"x":0.16872428537354581,"h":0.014553715960858749,"c":1},{"t":"EMPLOYEE: Bye.","x":0.073821438856637583,"h":0.015047556941163776,"c":1,"w":0.1364282480875651,"y":0.26150872122832469},{"w":0.026748971939086985,"t":"Q8","h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.84362139870123842,"y":0.094476744009031943,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.84156378555537648,"y":0.18604651141654238,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.026748971939086874,"t":"Q9"},{"x":0.84156378662463527,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.23255813935884695,"t":"Q10","h":0.014534883982160851},{"t":"PART 2","h":0.015059000471314921,"w":0.1050812276204427,"y":0.31223794160272256,"c":1,"x":0.071944982755597853},{"y":0.34156976730907584,"c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851,"t":"Good morning and thank you for coming here today. I'd like to bring you up to date with","x":0.069958860192111894,"w":0.69547322591145821},{"t":"changes in the school that will affect your children.","w":0.40350779215494792,"h":0.015466082362881384,"c":1,"x":0.071915133811439921,"y":0.35571585213550305},{"y":0.37793147863162324,"x":0.069896751593177556,"w":0.73675537109375,"c":1,"h":0.017652246499932134,"t":"As you know, the school buildings date from various times: some from the 1970s, some from"},{"w":0.7345679219563801,"c":1,"h":0.014545155919482911,"y":0.39534883707438673,"t":"the last five years, and of course Dartfield House is over a century old. It was commissioned","x":0.0699588371596091},{"t":"by a businessman, Neville Richards, and intended as his family home, but he died before it","y":0.41133720915636474,"c":1,"x":0.069958855482622179,"h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.72633743286132812},{"y":0.42550349712003532,"w":0.73057047526041663,"t":"was completed. His heir chose to sell it to the local council, who turned it into offices. A later","h":0.016525448842941715,"x":0.069900494012481426,"c":1},{"h":0.018768398163596656,"w":0.72449295043945305,"x":0.069875237615887612,"c":1,"t":"plan to convert it into a tourist information centre didn't come about, through lack of money,","y":0.43913959135431035},{"c":1,"x":0.071920520119550607,"t":"and instead it formed the nucleus of this school when it opened 40 years ago.","w":0.61955998738606766,"h":0.016463061805608303,"y":0.45495343516663278},{"t":"The school has grown as the local population has increased, and I can now give you some","h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.4796511626572324,"w":0.72016459147135414,"c":1,"x":0.072016469556019827},{"y":0.49558303879940824,"t":"news about the lower school site, which is separated from the main site by a road. Planning","h":0.016044868316470562,"x":0.069958838143424296,"w":0.72839508056640623,"c":1},{"h":0.014560563544642968,"w":0.71399175008138016,"y":0.5101744188539955,"x":0.069958854460338671,"c":1,"t":"permission has been granted for development of both sites. The lower school will move to"},{"t":"new buildings that will be constructed on the main site. Developers will construct houses on","c":1,"x":0.069873882965685349,"w":0.72858088175455737,"y":0.52447762940129894,"h":0.01753075636739021},{"y":0.54210836301203147,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"the existing lower school site. Work on the new school buildings should start within the next","w":0.73045267740885411,"x":0.067901233171270683,"c":1},{"h":0.013422544769179257,"c":1,"x":0.069671858891193233,"y":0.55530697191227241,"w":0.10361757278442382,"t":"few months."},{"t":"A more imminent change concerns the catering facilities and the canteen. The canteen is","x":0.072016463312989984,"w":0.70576131184895841,"h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.57979976455742555,"c":1},{"x":0.069882128013299502,"h":0.018131190952620058,"t":"always very busy throughout the lunch period - in fact it's often full to capacity, because a","w":0.71413686116536457,"c":1,"y":0.59409790284209785},{"t":"lot of our pupils like the food that's on offer there. But there's only one serving point, so most","y":0.60936636591586846,"w":0.7388392130533854,"h":0.01786590773871144,"c":1,"x":0.067814433999481685},{"x":0.069868895120153721,"t":"pupils have to wait a considerable time to be served. This is obviously unsatisfactory, as they","h":0.019085771765108062,"c":1,"w":0.73888432820638017,"y":0.62370116524023056},{"w":0.53716496785481782,"h":0.014981573125077641,"c":1,"x":0.071957827288183909,"t":"may have hardly finished their lunch before afternoon lessons start.","y":0.64057144235160624},{"w":0.72854827880859374,"t":"So we've had a new Food Hall built, and this will come into use next week. It'll have several","h":0.016860357583341368,"c":1,"x":0.069880458737366008,"y":0.66335892732593826},{"x":0.071939833147665888,"t":"serving areas, and I'll give you more details about those in a minute, but one thing we ask","w":0.71208506266276039,"h":0.016840744917187678,"c":1,"y":0.67852757777653527},{"w":0.70801086425781246,"t":"you to do, to help in the smooth running of the Food Hall, is to discuss with your children","y":0.69346804831377873,"c":1,"x":0.069886368657217965,"h":0.017313414664656079},{"x":0.071939391228546673,"w":0.69973378499348959,"t":"each morning which type of food they want to eat that day, so they can go straight to the","y":0.70997321762595111,"c":1,"h":0.015939323865623245},{"y":0.7244987443517571,"h":0.016886338187892758,"x":0.069876627868950242,"t":"relevant serving point. There won't be any junk food - everything on offer will be healthy -","w":0.71826532999674486,"c":1},{"w":0.72839508056640623,"t":"and there's no change to the current system of paying for lunches by topping up your child's","h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.072016451382281063,"y":0.74263839812661192,"c":1},{"t":"electronic payment card online.","y":0.75521049569174725,"w":0.25141120910644532,"x":0.071843298930568719,"h":0.015232464730809747,"c":1},{"w":0.73675526936848956,"t":"You may be wondering what will happen to the old canteen. We'll still have tables and chairs","h":0.016734099640863032,"x":0.067838462211866693,"c":1,"y":0.77903170199212768},{"x":0.067841711713240327,"c":1,"h":0.016804757472061782,"y":0.79427006888759843,"t":"in there, and pupils can eat food from the Food Hall or lunch they've brought from home.","w":0.70589050292968758},{"t":"Eventually we may use part of the canteen for storage, but first we'll see how many pupils go","x":0.072016458548340462,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.81095406349658838,"w":0.73662551879882809},{"h":0.017516242882107402,"w":0.17785760243733725,"y":0.82432362539500537,"x":0.065410834441279958,"t":"in there at lunchtime.","c":1},{"t":"Q11","y":0.42503729304770799,"w":0.038014914194742899,"x":0.83995436574861282,"h":0.016362785590972706,"c":1},{"t":"Q12","y":0.52761627891373908,"x":0.84156378660572351,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"c":1,"y":0.61191860449513436,"t":"Q13","x":0.83950617206944589,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.039094651540120484},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Q14","x":0.83950617384751769,"y":0.69622093000599283,"w":0.039094648361206019,"c":1},{"t":"Q15","c":1,"x":0.83950617344910272,"y":0.78197674404735451,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.90406976769120473,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.014534882858869502,"c":1,"t":"105","x":0.87037037128255712},{"y":0.95559854902539954,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.25427068074544268,"x":0.71952531067331094,"h":0.027081890577983492,"c":1}],"w":2400}